    "detailed_description": "<strong>They grow even when you are not around.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1438100/extras/4da0a008c6418605c8b87557858b2a61.poster.avif?t=1639632155\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1438100/extras/4da0a008c6418605c8b87557858b2a61.webm?t=1639632155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1438100/extras/4da0a008c6418605c8b87557858b2a61.mp4?t=1639632155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>At first glance, <strong>\u00abQbio\u00bb</strong> may seem like a simple and even trivial game, but once you try and get a little more comfortable, the gameplay will rapidly gain momentum, opening up new opportunities, expanding the scope for strategy and changing the rules.<br><br><strong>\u00abQbio\u00bb</strong> is friendly to everyone and able to offer a unique gaming experience to both the housewife and the esports player.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1438100/extras/f5b2024c2b8c765076a1b43cad080811.poster.avif?t=1639632155\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1438100/extras/f5b2024c2b8c765076a1b43cad080811.webm?t=1639632155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1438100/extras/f5b2024c2b8c765076a1b43cad080811.mp4?t=1639632155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>The positive and completely non-serious atmosphere of the game will allow you to relax after a hard day or while away your free time.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1438100/extras/50a7216782174e8c976901e353d0db50.poster.avif?t=1639632155\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1438100/extras/50a7216782174e8c976901e353d0db50.webm?t=1639632155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1438100/extras/50a7216782174e8c976901e353d0db50.mp4?t=1639632155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>And remember, you can leave the farm or even turn off the game, but they will continue to grow\u2026</strong><br><br><strong>\u00abQbio\u00bb</strong> is waiting for you.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>They grow even when you are not around.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1438100/extras/4da0a008c6418605c8b87557858b2a61.poster.avif?t=1639632155\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1438100/extras/4da0a008c6418605c8b87557858b2a61.webm?t=1639632155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1438100/extras/4da0a008c6418605c8b87557858b2a61.mp4?t=1639632155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>At first glance, <strong>\u00abQbio\u00bb</strong> may seem like a simple and even trivial game, but once you try and get a little more comfortable, the gameplay will rapidly gain momentum, opening up new opportunities, expanding the scope for strategy and changing the rules.<br><br><strong>\u00abQbio\u00bb</strong> is friendly to everyone and able to offer a unique gaming experience to both the housewife and the esports player.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1438100/extras/f5b2024c2b8c765076a1b43cad080811.poster.avif?t=1639632155\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1438100/extras/f5b2024c2b8c765076a1b43cad080811.webm?t=1639632155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1438100/extras/f5b2024c2b8c765076a1b43cad080811.mp4?t=1639632155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>The positive and completely non-serious atmosphere of the game will allow you to relax after a hard day or while away your free time.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1438100/extras/50a7216782174e8c976901e353d0db50.poster.avif?t=1639632155\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1438100/extras/50a7216782174e8c976901e353d0db50.webm?t=1639632155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1438100/extras/50a7216782174e8c976901e353d0db50.mp4?t=1639632155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>And remember, you can leave the farm or even turn off the game, but they will continue to grow\u2026</strong><br><br><strong>\u00abQbio\u00bb</strong> is waiting for you.",
